DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
DTSTART:20261109T161500
DTEND:20261109T170200
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SUMMARY:Upper-body calisthenics
DESCRIPTION:Stop 2 reps short on every set. Quality over fatigue.\n• Warm-
 up: skipping rope — 3 min\n• Warm-up: arm circles\, inchworms ×5 — 2 min\
 n• Warm-up: wrist circles\, shoulder dislocates\, scap pull-ups — 5 min\n
 • Ramp-up: 1 easy set of pull-ups at half effort — 2 min\n• Chest-to-wall
  handstand — 5 × 15–20s\n• Pull-ups — 3 × ~8–10\, stop 2 short\n• Dips\, 
 elbows to ~90° — 3 × stop 2 short\n• Inverted rows — 3 × 10–12\n• Hollow 
 hold — 4 × 10–15s\n• Tuck L-sit on dip bars — 3 × 10s\n• Mobility: hips\,
  hamstrings\, groin — 10 min
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Upper-body calisthenics
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
