BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:plan-0-lower-a@elijah-os
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
DTSTART:20261109T181500
DTEND:20261109T185200
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SUMMARY:Lower body A (strength)
DESCRIPTION:Strength\, the day after the match: stop 2–3 reps short on eve
 ry set. Played 60+ minutes yesterday\, or legs 2 or lower in the check-in
 ? Do one set less of each.\n• Warm-up: easy bike — 3 min\n• Warm-up: leg 
 swings\, glute bridges ×10\, bodyweight squats ×10 — 2 min\n• Ramp-up: 1 
 easy set of split squats at half effort — 2 min\n• Rear-foot elevated spl
 it squats (back foot on a chair or step) — 3 × 6–8 each leg\n• Single-leg
  RDL — 3 × 8 each leg\n• Slider hamstring curls (socks on a hard floor\, 
 or heels on a towel) — 3 × 6–8\n• Copenhagen plank (top knee on a bench\,
  side plank\, short lever) — 3 × 15–20s each side\n• Single-leg calf rais
 es (on a step) — 2 × 12–15 each leg
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Lower body A (strength)
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
