BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:plan-0-wall-mastery@elijah-os
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
DTSTART:20261109T191000
DTEND:20261109T194500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SUMMARY:Wall session: ball mastery
DESCRIPTION:Non-negotiable. Quick\, soft touches on the balls of your feet
 \; head up between moves. Level up: go faster\, then do it all eyes-up.\n
 • Warm-up: skipping rope — 3 min\n• Warm-up: leg swings\, hip openers\, h
 igh knees — 2 min\n• Two-touch wall passing\, both feet — 6 min\n• One-to
 uch wall passing — 4 min\n• Ball mastery circuit: sole rolls\, V-pulls\, 
 L-turns\, croquetas\, Ronaldo chops\, inside-outside\, Matthews feint\, r
 oll-cut — 8 × 40s on\, 20s off (8 min)\n• Tight-box combos: 4 cones 2 m a
 part — 7 min\n• Weak foot only wall passing — 5 min
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Wall session: ball mastery
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:plan-1-astro-skill@elijah-os
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
DTSTART:20261110T154500
DTEND:20261110T164100
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SUMMARY:Astro: skill sequences
DESCRIPTION:Solo: just balls and cones. Bring 3+ balls and 4–6 cones. Abou
 t 75% pace: half speed first\, then full speed.\n• Warm-up 1\, raise: eas
 y jog with the ball\, light touches with both feet — 3 min\n• Warm-up 2\,
  mobilise: leg swings (front and side)\, hip openers\, walking lunges wit
 h a twist\, inchworms — 3 min\n• Warm-up 3\, activate: glute bridges ×10\
 , A-skips\, carioca\, high knees — 2 min\n• Warm-up 4\, sharpen: 3 build-
 ups at 70%\, 80%\, 90%\, quick feet\, 2 short sprints with the ball — 4 m
 in\n• Back to goal\, roll the ball past your side\, open up and take it o
 n the half-turn\, drive past a cone\, shoot — 4 × 5 reps\n• Weak foot: th
 row the ball up and control it with your weak foot (or thigh or chest fir
 st)\, then weak-foot finishes — 10 min\n• Skills under fatigue: 20s fast 
 ball mastery (croquetas\, inside-outside\, sole rolls) → 10 m dribble fla
 t out → Ronaldo chop or Cruyff turn at the cone → sprint back → finish — 
 2 × 6 rounds\, 40s rest\n• Cool-down: 2 min easy jog\, then stretch hamst
 rings\, quads\, hip flexors and calves — 5 min
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Astro: skill sequences
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
