SUMMARY:Lower body B (power\, light)
DESCRIPTION:Light and springy: academy is tomorrow. Plyos first while you’
 re fresh\; the heavy strength work was on Monday.\n• Warm-up: easy bike —
  3 min\n• Warm-up: leg swings\, walking lunges\, glute bridges ×10 — 2 mi
 n\n• Ramp-up: 1 easy set of glute bridges at half effort — 2 min\n• Plyom
 etrics: pogo hops (quick\, stiff ankles) — 2 × 15\n• Plyometrics: lateral
  bounds (stick each landing) — 2 × 5 each side\n• Single-leg glute bridge
  — 2 × 12 each leg\n• Lateral lunges — 2 × 8 each side\n• Skill snack: tu
 ck L-sit holds — 10 min
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Lower body B (power\, light)
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
