BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:plan-4-astro-speed@elijah-os
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
DTSTART:20261113T154500
DTEND:20261113T164500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SUMMARY:Astro: speed + match reps
DESCRIPTION:Solo. Bring 3+ balls and 6 cones so you’re not chasing balls. 
 Full recovery between sprints\; stop after 2 slow reps.\n• Warm-up 1\, ra
 ise: easy jog with the ball\, light touches with both feet — 3 min\n• War
 m-up 2\, mobilise: leg swings (front and side)\, hip openers\, walking lu
 nges with a twist\, inchworms — 3 min\n• Warm-up 3\, activate: glute brid
 ges ×10\, A-skips\, B-skips\, carioca — 2 min\n• Warm-up 4\, sharpen: qui
 ck feet\, 3 strides at 70%\, 80%\, 90% — 4 min\n• Plyometrics: broad jump
 s (max effort\, stick the landing) — 3 × 3\n• Plyometrics: single-leg bou
 nds — 2 × 4 each leg\n• 10m sprints — 3 × 1\n• 20m sprints — 2 × 1\n• Run
 s in behind: knock the ball past a cone into space\, sprint onto it\, one
  touch\, shoot — 6–8 reps\n• Near-post darts: set the ball out wide\, dar
 t to the near post\, finish first time — 6–8 reps\, half weak foot\n• 1v1
  into shot: run at a cone “defender” at speed\, do a move\, burst past\, 
 shoot — 6–8 reps\n• Finishing from self-set balls\, at least half weak fo
 ot — 10 min\n• Skills under fatigue: 2 hard 20 m shuttles → set yourself 
 a ball → beat a cone with a move → finish — 4 × 1 round\n• Skill snack: h
 andstand kick-ups — 10 min\n• Cool-down: 2 min easy jog\, then stretch ha
 mstrings\, quads\, hip flexors and calves — 5 min
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Astro: speed + match reps
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
