 ers\, high knees — 2 min\n• Two-touch wall passing\, both feet — 6 min\n•
  Juggling progressions — 8 min\n• Close-control circuit: roll-cut\, insid
 e-outside\, croqueta\, pull-push\, outside cut — 5 × 45s on\, 15s off (5 
